<title>NETHERLANDS: GILISSEN CUTS ASM '96, '97 EPS FORECASTS.</title>
<headline>GILISSEN CUTS ASM '96, '97 EPS FORECASTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sept 25 research.</p>
<p>Company------------Sector------Price--------Broker--------</p>
<p>ASM Lithography  Electronics   62.80   Theodoor Gilissen</p>
<p>COMMENT: Company told Sept 20 seminar that market for wafer</p>
<p>steppers still deteriorating. Order backlog worsening faster</p>
<p>than previously thought. Recommendation cut to hold from buy.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):    EPS	pvs     P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	 4.06     --	15.5	 nil</p>
<p>    1996		    6.25     6.75    10.1</p>
<p>    1997		    6.00     9.00    10.5</p>
